android_kernel_oneplus_sm8550
Kernel tree for the OnePlus 11 (Qualcomm SM8550, OPPO project 22811, codename
salami). Forked from OnePlus open source and extended with third-party PD3.0 PPS
charging support.

1. UPSTREAM

   Repo:    https://github.com/OnePlusOSS/android_kernel_oneplus_sm8550
   Branch:  oneplus/sm8550_b_16.0.0_oneplus_11
   Fork point: 8b939bbf6d30
     Synchronize code for OnePlus CPH2447_16.0.5.1301(EX01), CPH2449_16.0.5.1301,
     CPH2451_16.0.5.1301 and PHB110_16.0.5.1301. Based on QCOM release TAG
     AU_LINUX_KERNEL.PLATFORM.2.0.R1.00.00.00.004.146.

   The upstream baseline is Qualcomm msm-5.15 (kalama) plus Android common kernel
   5.15 (GKI). This tree is 5.15.197.

   Submodules:
     common/                  OnePlusOSS/android_kernel_common_oneplus_sm8550
     devicetree/sm8550/       OnePlusOSS/android_kernel_modules_and_devicetree_oneplus_sm8550
     third_party/AnyKernel3   osm0sis/AnyKernel3

2. WHAT THIS FORK ADDS

   17 commits after the fork point, all written by Aibeto.

   Build and packaging, acddc8fe3bb6 to 26c49bff7753:
     .gitmodules, .github/workflows/build-gki.yml, scripts/build-gki.sh,
     scripts/fetch-clang.sh, scripts/setup-tree.sh, scripts/pack_anykernel3.sh,
     scripts/anykernel.sh, and a stray patch fragment removed from
     kernel/sched/core.c

   Third-party PPS support, bdd1fc6b2fd0 to current HEAD:
     tools/dtbo/, tools/pps-dtbo/, tools/pps-build/
     SUPPORT.md, PPS_HANDOFF.md, PPS_RUNTIME_AUDIT.md, PPS_55W_MIGRATION_PLAN.md

   The charging code changes live in the submodule devicetree/sm8550:
     4d11ef49  dt: enable third-party PPS for 22811 and add 11V/5A strategy data
     2a79fb5a  pps: make the v1 PPS engine work on 22811 without a charge pump

